      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p style=\"\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https:https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/12/alphabet.png\" style=\"width: 450px; height: 107px;\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">The pattern followed is,</p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Option (1):&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">MPT : JRS</span><br />\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/07/F7_Vinanti_Railway_03.07.23_D4.png\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); width: 97px; height: 121px;\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Option (2):<strong>&nbsp;</strong></span><strong><span style=\"\">PJQ : MGP</span></strong><br />\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/07/F7_Vinanti_Railway_03.07.23_D5.png\" style=\"width: 97px; height: 186px;\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Option (3):&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">WKH : TMG</span><br />\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/07/F7_Vinanti_Railway_03.07.23_D6.png\" style=\"width: 97px; height: 121px;\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Option (4):&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">QJS : NLR</span><br />\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/07/F7_Vinanti_Railway_03.07.23_D7.png\" style=\"width: 97px; height: 121px;\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">All follow the same pattern, except&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">&#39;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">PJQ : MGP&rsquo;.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">Hence,&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">&ldquo;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">PJQ : MGP&rdquo;</span>&nbsp;is the odd one.</p>\n",
