    {
      "id": "509cfca36cbb-q5",
      "number": 5,
      "question": "Three of the following four-letter clusters are alike in a certain way and thus form a group. Select the letter cluster which does NOT belong to that group.",
      "questionHtml": "Three of the following four-letter clusters are alike in a certain way and thus form a&nbsp;group. Select the letter cluster which does NOT belong to that group.",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "BAG",
          "html": "BAG"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "BOW",
          "html": "BOW"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "BRY",
          "html": "BRY"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "TOM",
          "html": "TOM<span style=\"display: none;\">&nbsp;</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p><strong>Logic:</strong></p>\n\n<p>Each letter cluster has one vowel.</p>\n\n<p>Checking all the options:</p>\n\n<p>(1) B<strong>A</strong>G&nbsp;&rarr; One vowel and two consonants.</p>\n\n<p>(2) B<strong>O</strong>W&nbsp;<span style=\"\">&rarr;&nbsp;One vowel and two consonants.</span></p>\n\n<p>(3) BRY&nbsp;<span style=\"\">&rarr; <strong>All three are&nbsp;consonants.</strong></span></p>\n\n<p>(4) T<strong>O</strong>M&nbsp;<span style=\"\">&rarr;&nbsp;One vowel and two consonants.</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">Here, <strong>&#39;BRY&#39;</strong> is different from the others.</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">Hence, the correct answer is <strong>&quot;BRY&quot;.</strong></span></p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
