    {
      "id": "509cfca36cbb-q8",
      "number": 8,
      "question": "Choose the odd one out of the given options.",
      "questionHtml": "Choose the odd one out of the given options.",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "CDG",
          "html": "CDG"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "AEH",
          "html": "AEH"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "DJA",
          "html": "DJA"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "HBD",
          "html": "HBD"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>The pattern followed is,&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/20/08/Common_Diagram_28.01.2020_D1.png\" style=\"width: 536px; height: 128px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>Logic: For all the other option sum of place&nbsp;value is 14&nbsp;except &ldquo;DJA&rdquo;</p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width:200px;\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">CDG</td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;3 + 4 + 7 = 14</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">AEH</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;1 + 5 + 8 = 14</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>DJA</strong></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>4 + 10 + 1 = 15</strong></td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">HBD</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">8 + 2 + 4 = 14</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p><br />\nHence, &ldquo;DJA&rdquo; is the correct answer.</p>\n",
      "images": [
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/20/08/Common_Diagram_28.01.2020_D1.png"
