    {
      "id": "509cfca36cbb-q9",
      "number": 9,
      "question": "Identify the odd pair from the following.",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Identify the odd pair from the following.</p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "F - C",
          "html": "F - C"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "H - E",
          "html": "H - E"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "D &ndash; B",
          "html": "D &ndash; B"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "E - B",
          "html": "E - B"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>The pattern followed is,</p>\n\n<p>1) F &ndash; C &rarr; F - 3 = C</p>\n\n<p>2) H &ndash;&nbsp; E &rarr; H&nbsp;- 3&nbsp;= E</p>\n\n<p><strong>3) D &ndash; B&nbsp;&rarr; D&nbsp;- 2&nbsp;= B&nbsp;</strong></p>\n\n<p>4) E &ndash; B&nbsp;&rarr; E -&nbsp;3 = B&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Hence, &ldquo;D &ndash; B&rdquo; is odd one.</p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
